#NEXUS

[ boyd2015a_fig5: Rectangular time tree over coloured period bands with white range bars at the tips; many branches are long horizontal lines that run behind the bars. Polytomies: four heterodontosaurids, Hexinlusaurus-Yandusaurus-Leaellynasaura with the rest of Neornithischia, three Thescelosaurus species, Macrogryphosaurus-Notohypsilophodon-Talenkauen, Stenopelix-Micropachycephalosaurus-rest, Rhabdodon-Tenontosaurus-Zalmoxes-rest, and Callovosaurus with two dryosaurid pairs. Node numbers 1-18 (some with black dots or ticks) are not clade names and are not encoded. 65 tips, 7 polytomies (4, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4, 3 children). Sample 10 case (census 3, seed 20261274). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

